sequenceDiagram
    participant V as 对话页面
    participant C as DialogueController
    participant S as DialogueService
    participant L as AiCallLogService
    participant A as AiClient
    participant G as DeepSeek
    participant D as 数据库
    V->>C: POST 学生这一句
    C->>S: send(id, text)
    S->>D: 读取状态，保存学生消息
    Note over S: 用 dialogue_turn_v3 拼提示词
    S->>L: call(任务, 版本, 请求)
    L->>A: chat(请求)
    A->>G: POST /chat/completions
    G-->>A: JSON 内容和 token 用量
    A-->>L: ChatResult
    L->>D: 写入调用日志
    L-->>S: 结果和日志编号
